{
  "summary": "This experiment tested multimodal integration by combining the scvi_n200 RNA encoder with the imagenet_vit_l image encoder, using avgpool aggregation and concat fusion. Validation accuracy (0.7150) and F1 (0.6872) exceed the RNA-only baseline (0.6501), suggesting multimodal data may improve performance. However, the specific contribution of the image encoder or fusion method remains uncertain without direct comparison to alternative image encoders or fusion strategies."
}

